1181:Source/main.c ****      * form field), the app must not react to buttons AT ALL — the keyboard
1182:Source/main.c ****      * reads the hardware itself, so an A press meant for typing previously
1183:Source/main.c ****      * also launched bookmarks/links/cursor actions underneath. Zero the
1184:Source/main.c ****      * app-visible button state; the keyboard's own button reader is
1185:Source/main.c ****      * unaffected. This holds for EVERY app state (home, page, …). */
